@startuml
title Figure X: User Login Participant Diagram

' Professional Styling
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam boundary {
    BackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    BorderColor #0078d4
}

skinparam control {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
}

skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #f6fff6
    BorderColor #228b22
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
    FontSize 11
}

actor User
boundary "Login Page" as UI <<Boundary>>
control "SupabaseAuthService" as Auth <<Control>>
entity "Supabase Auth" as Supabase <<Entity>>
entity "Audit Log (DB)" as DB <<Entity>>
entity "LocalStorage" as LS <<Entity>>

User - UI : 1: Submit Credentials\n(Email, Password, Remember Me)
UI - Auth : 2: loginUser()
Auth - Supabase : 3: signInWithPassword()
Supabase - Auth : 4: Return User/Session
Auth - DB : 5: log_user_action('login')
Auth - UI : 6: Success Response
UI - LS : 7: Store/Clear 'rememberEmail'
UI - User : 8: Navigate to Dashboard

note right of UI
  **Alternative Flow:**
  If credentials invalid,
  Auth returns Error,
  UI displays error message.
end note

@enduml
